This entry holds the shape of an article — a publication date, an optional
revision date, topics and a pointer to a successor — without pretending to be
the migrated text.

The pointer is the field worth noticing. Phase 3 consolidates the archive, and
an article that is folded into another names its survivor rather than quietly
competing with it. The redirect row and the canonical URL both follow from that
one decision instead of being remembered separately.
